;; Ryu's training stage (0.4.38, src/game/tutorial/heroes/ryu.ts; docs/HEROES.md), in the Ninja
;; Gaiden city-street look: the sword at an enemy (gate 16), a cling to the shaft's wall and kicks
;; up between its walls onto the roof (only wall jumps reach it), the Medicine and the Throwing Star
;; at a target (gate 47), the Ninpo Scroll and the Windmill Star through two targets (gate 63), the
;; Fire Wheel's flames against a shooter (gate 78), Jump and Slash at the walkers out of the pipe
;; (gate 95) and the flagpole. Each power block's item is in [hero-items]; the gates are laid by the
;; tutorial.
